  "port_plugins: core plugin names; a PORT id belongs to the lane whose plugin is the row's target_crate",
  "owns: path globs relative to the workspace root; with '**' a glob covers every file below the directory. The more specific glob wins when two lanes match (for example a test directory inside a skeleton crate)"
